{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42439","headline":"再次前韵代梅荅 · 汤悦","name":"再次前韵代梅荅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"托植经多稔，顷筐向盛时。\n枝条虽已故，情分不曾移。\n莫向堦前老，还同镜里衰。\n更应怜堕叶，残吹挂虫丝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"汤悦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42439.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42439","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}